<title>USA: USDA amends GSM-102 for West African region.</title>
<headline>USDA amends GSM-102 for West African region.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department Monday said freight coverage is now available for sales of U.S. wheat and rice to the West African region under the Export Credit Guarantee Program (GSM-102).</p>
<p>USDA said the total 1996 authorization for sales to the West African region under GSM-102 remains unchanged at $50 million.</p>
</text>
